   "label": "Aadhaar (Last 4 Digits Only)",
   "read_only": 1,
   "description": "DPDP Act minimisation — the full Aadhaar number is never received or stored by FlameZO; it is handled entirely within the eSign provider's UIDAI-compliant flow. Only the last 4 digits (for the signer to visually confirm which identity signed) are persisted here."
